{"id":"99718","name":"腌雪里红","author":"徐徐5947599","authorId":"5947599","desc":"","cover":"images/99718/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"雪里红","amount":"一捆"}],"sub":[{"name":"腌制盐","amount":"半袋"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"雪里红一捆","img":"images/99718/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"晾晒一天","img":"images/99718/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"之后准备洗干净","img":"images/99718/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"清水冲洗几遍干净为好","img":"images/99718/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"准备好的腌制盐","img":"images/99718/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"一捆菜半袋烟，400克左右","img":"images/99718/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"洗净之后打成小捆","img":"images/99718/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"像这样","img":"images/99718/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"卷一下，既好放又好取","img":"images/99718/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"卷好后放入盆中","img":"images/99718/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"码严实","img":"images/99718/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"一层菜一层盐","img":"images/99718/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"全部码放好后再撒上一层盐","img":"images/99718/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"然后用一块大石头压上，充分压出水分","img":"images/99718/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"第二天倒进坛子里继续腌制","img":"images/99718/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"演过一天之后的样子","img":"images/99718/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"-5天就可以吃了，当然两周后就完全可以吃了","img":"images/99718/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"看；我腌的不错吧，又脆又绿的。呵呵，大功告成","img":"images/99718/step_18.jpg"}],"tips":"千万不要加水哦，而且洗之前晾晒一天特别重要，否则水分过大不好吃 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}